    45	# Proof-extension inventory
    46	
    47	## `scanParenGroups`
    48	
    49	- Class: definitional summary.
    50	- Semantic role: names the mathematical value of the loop accumulator; it
    51	  does not rewrite `<k>` and does not replace program execution.
    52	- Domain: all `IntSeq`, integer depths, current `IntSeq`, and `ValSeq`
